Yudhājit fetches Bharata and Śatrughna --- Brothers take leave and depart for Kēkaya --- Brothers enjoy honor and miss Daśaratha --- Daśaratha cherishes four sons, misses absent two --- Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa serve father, mothers, gurus, city --- Realm praises gentle, learned, invincible Rāma --- Earth desires Rāma as lord --- Daśaratha resolves with ministers to consecrate Rāma --- Daśaratha summons kings and countrymen
